  "Could not delete this image.": "Kunde inte ta bort bilden.",
  "Billing status could not be verified, so paid features are temporarily locked. Apply the Sprint 121\u2013132 migration if this is a new install.": "Faktureringsstatus kunde inte verifieras, s\xE5 betalfunktioner \xE4r tillf\xE4lligt l\xE5sta. Till\xE4mpa migreringen f\xF6r Sprint 121\u2013132 om detta \xE4r en ny installation.",
  "The requested website is not visible in your current cloud projects.": "Den beg\xE4rda webbplatsen syns inte bland dina aktuella molnprojekt.",
  "Payment completed. Stripe is syncing your subscription; refresh billing if the badge does not update immediately.": "Betalningen \xE4r klar. Stripe synkroniserar din prenumeration; uppdatera faktureringen om m\xE4rket inte \xE4ndras direkt.",
  "Checkout was canceled. Your current plan was not changed.": "Kassan avbr\xF6ts. Din nuvarande plan \xE4ndrades inte.",
  "The website changed after this quality review. Run the quality check again before applying fixes.": "Webbplatsen \xE4ndrades efter den h\xE4r kvalitetsgranskningen. K\xF6r kvalitetskontrollen igen innan du till\xE4mpar korrigeringar.",
  "Release history is unavailable. Apply the Sprint 97-108 database migration.": "Versionshistoriken \xE4r inte tillg\xE4nglig. Till\xE4mpa databas\xE4ndringen f\xF6r Sprint 97-108.",
  "The site files exist, but the public website renderer did not return HTML. Try Publish again after refreshing Tayar.": "Webbplatsfilerna finns, men den publika webbplatsrenderaren returnerade inte HTML. F\xF6rs\xF6k publicera igen efter att du har uppdaterat Tayar.",
  "Only the project owner can create public share previews.": "Endast projekt\xE4garen kan skapa publika delningsf\xF6rhandsvisningar.",
  "Save this project to the cloud before creating a share preview.": "Spara projektet i molnet innan du skapar en delningsf\xF6rhandsvisning.",
  "The latest editor changes could not be synchronized before creating the preview.": "De senaste redigerings\xE4ndringarna kunde inte synkroniseras innan f\xF6rhandsvisningen skapades.",
  "Only the project owner can rollback a published release.": "Endast projekt\xE4garen kan \xE5terst\xE4lla en publicerad version.",
  "This release snapshot does not belong to the active project.": "Den h\xE4r versions\xF6gonblicksbilden tillh\xF6r inte det aktiva projektet.",
  "Only the project owner can delete release archives.": "Endast projekt\xE4garen kan ta bort versionsarkiv.",
  "You cannot delete the release currently serving as the live rollback reference.": "Du kan inte ta bort versionen som just nu anv\xE4nds som \xE5terst\xE4llningsreferens f\xF6r den live-publicerade versionen.",
  "Opening your saved website. Save will continue when it is loaded.": "Din sparade webbplats \xF6ppnas. Sparandet forts\xE4tter n\xE4r den har l\xE4sts in.",
  "Your existing website is still reconnecting. Tayar will not create a duplicate draft while its saved identity is available.": "Din befintliga webbplats \xE5teransluter fortfarande. Tayar skapar inte ett dubblettutkast s\xE5 l\xE4nge den sparade identiteten finns tillg\xE4nglig.",
  "Opening your most recent saved website before saving. No duplicate draft was created.": "Den senast sparade webbplatsen \xF6ppnas f\xF6re sparning. Inget dubblettutkast skapades.",
  "This shared project is read-only for your Viewer role.": "Det h\xE4r delade projektet \xE4r skrivskyddat f\xF6r din Viewer-roll.",
  "Local recovery storage is full. Cloud save will still be attempted.": "Det lokala \xE5terst\xE4llningslagret \xE4r fullt. Molnsparning kommer fortfarande att f\xF6rs\xF6ka k\xF6ras.",
  "You are offline. Changes are saved locally and will retry when the connection returns.": "Du \xE4r offline. \xC4ndringar sparas lokalt och f\xF6rs\xF6ks igen n\xE4r anslutningen \xE5terkommer.",
  "This history snapshot does not belong to the active project.": "Den h\xE4r historik\xF6gonblicksbilden tillh\xF6r inte det aktiva projektet.",
